@TroyOS_Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7295

### Empty prompt: 400
POST {{TroyOS_Api_HostAddress}}/api/prompt/improve
Content-Type: application/json

{"prompt":"   "}

### Valid prompt: 200 when Gemini:ApiKey is configured
POST {{TroyOS_Api_HostAddress}}/api/prompt/improve
Content-Type: application/json

{"prompt":"You are a concise technical editor. Improve this release note."}

### Unsupported content type: 415
POST {{TroyOS_Api_HostAddress}}/api/prompt/improve
Content-Type: text/plain

not-json